Data formats
------------

The ingest presets (src/graduate/ingest/presets.py) read the published formats
of third-party datasets and benchmarks (τ²-bench, Hermes function calling,
Toucan, Nemotron-Agentic, SWE-rebench). No third-party data is redistributed
here; see REFERENCES.md for sources and licences.
